        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Zod was an ancient black dragon of incredible power.  So powerful, in fact, that even the red's were afraid of him.\n\nCreatures of minor power and lesser intelligence such as kobolds and goblins often fall into the worship of dragons believing them to be gods walking among us.  Zod was so powerful even humans worshipped him."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 2,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
