          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Zod's power grew so great, in fact, that even Tiamat took notice.  The Mistress of Dragons grew jealous of Zod's influence, and Zod's ego had grown with his power.\n\nBut the Mistress of Dragons is not to be trifled with, and when Zod's ego grew too great she put him in his place."
          }
        }
      },
