        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "After his death, Zod's temple grew into disarray.  But it is still a place that attracts evil.  It is said to be buried somewhere within this swamp, and rumor has it that there are great riches to any brave enough to find it and venture within its depths."
          }
